     code for the project named ''orion''?\\n\\nThis is the expected criteria for your\n+      final answer: The access code, exactly as the tool returned it\\nyou MUST return\n+      the actual complete content as the final answer, not a summary.\"}],\"model\":\"gpt-6.1-sol\",\"tool_choice\":\"auto\",\"tools\":[{\"type\":\"function\",\"function\":{\"name\":\"lookup_code\",\"description\":\"Look\n+      up the access code for a project by name.\",\"strict\":true,\"parameters\":{\"properties\":{\"name\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"name\"],\"type\":\"object\",\"additionalProperties\":false}}}]}'\n+    headers:\n+      User-Agent:\n+      - X-USER-AGENT-XXX\n+      accept:\n+      - application/json\n+      accept-encoding:\n+      - ACCEPT-ENCODING-XXX\n+      authorization:\n+      - AUTHORIZATION-XXX\n+      connection:\n+      - keep-alive\n+      content-length:\n+      - '764'\n+      content-type:\n+      - application/json\n+      cookie:\n+      - COOKIE-XXX\n+      host:\n+      - api.openai.com\n+      x-stainless-arch:\n+      - X-STAINLESS-ARCH-XXX\n+      x-stainless-async:\n+      - 'false'\n+      x-stainless-lang:\n+      - python\n+      x-stainless-os:\n+      - X-STAINLESS-OS-XXX\n+      x-stainless-package-version:\n+      - 2.41.0\n+      x-stainless-raw-response:\n+      - 'true'\n+      x-stainless-read-timeout:\n+      - X-STAINLESS-READ-TIMEOUT-XXX\n+      x-stainless-retry-count:\n+      - '0'\n+      x-stainless-runtime:\n+      - CPython\n+      x-stainless-runtime-version:\n+      - 3.13.5\n+    method: POST\n+    uri: https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions\n+  response:\n+    body:\n+      string: \"{\\n  \\\"error\\\": {\\n    \\\"message\\\": \\\"Function tools with reasoning_effort\n+        are not supported for gpt-6.1-sol in /v1/chat/completions. To use function\n+        tools, use /v1/responses or set reasoning_effort to 'none'.\\\",\\n    \\\"type\\\":\n+        \\\"invalid_request_error\\\",\\n    \\\"param\\\": \